            <ArticleTitle>Complete duplication of bladder and urethra in coronal plane with no other anomalies: case report with review of the literature.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>388</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Complete duplication of the bladder and urethra is a very rare congenital anomaly that is usually associated with other congenital anomalies. We report the case of a 7-year-old boy with complete duplication of the bladder and urethra in the anteroposterior plane, without any other associated congenital anomalies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
